A: <pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>async function errorFunc(){
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; setTimeout(() =&gt; reject(&quot;Any error occured!&quot;), 1000))
}
</code></pre>
<p>this is what you want.</p>
<hr />
<pre><code>setTimeout(callback, ms)
</code></pre>
<p><code>callback</code> will be exec in global, no one catch it.</p>

