A: <p>You seem to want to use MySQL, yet have put the "<em>persistence provider</em>" as ObjectDB. That is a contradiction. ObjectDB as a JPA provider only supports persistence to itself (an Object Database - ODBMS); ask yourself where in the ObjectDB docs did it say it supports persistence to MySQL?. </p>

