To retrieve the selected value from the jQuery auto-suggest plugin, you should utilize the `resultClick` callback function provided in your implementation. This function gets called with the selected items as its argument. Here’s how you can modify your current code to alert the selected name when an item is clicked:

```javascript
var data = {items: [
