<p><code>isDescendent()</code> borrowed from <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2234979/how-to-check-in-javascript-if-one-element-is-contained-within-another">How to check in Javascript if one element is contained within another</a></p>

<p>The menu can then be hidden with <code>element.style.display = 'none'</code></p>

<p>I would question motivation to not use jQuery, you'll be making a lot more work for yourself in the long run... </p>

