[SO-32910202] Q: How to do Ajax login with Spring Security on Grails and AngularJS
A: <p>So here is the problem. The Spring Security plugin only accepts <code>POST</code> request with data as query string and when we pass some data in POST request via Angular's <code>$http</code> call, it sends data in request payload body which breaks login and you are getting the message that no user found.</p>

