<p>If I understand your case correctly (the need to be able to navigate your site even when offline), then the correct solution is to</p>
<ul>
<li>register a ServiceWorker,</li>
<li>make this ServiceWorker store all the required resources, including your images, in the browser's cache through the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Cache" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Cache API</a>,</li>
<li>make it retrieve the resources from the cache when your page fetches it again (e.g at next reload).</li>
