    Matcher matcher;

    private boolean isMatchPattern(String text) {
        matcher = pattern.matcher(text);
        return matcher.find();
    }
}
</code></pre>
<p>Behind the scenes, upon each call of <code>String.matches</code>, a new <code>Pattern</code> and <code>Matcher</code> object is created.</p>
