Q: The POST method is not supported for this route. Supported methods: GET, HEAD. - Laravel
A: <p>As mentioned above, try changing the form action line to the following:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;form action=&quot;/images_update&quot; method=&quot;post&quot;&gt;
</code></pre>
