<pre><code>document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild( '&lt;link rel="preload" href="' + xhrResponse.script + '" as="script"&gt;' );
</code></pre>

<p>This will begin loading your script in the background without executing it, so it can be applied immediately when you apply the script tag to the dom later.</p>

