<p>Either change the structure of the JSON so it starts with an object or an array:</p>
<pre><code>{
    &quot;html&quot;: &quot;&lt;html&gt;...&lt;/html&gt;&quot;
}
</code></pre>
<p>or change the data format you are sending:</p>
<pre><code>&quot;Content-Type: text/html&quot;
</code></pre>
<p>and</p>
<pre><code> body: &quot;&lt;html&gt;...&lt;/html&gt;&quot; // without JSON.stringify
</code></pre>
<hr />
<p>Obviously, you'll need to change the server-side code to accept the changed format.</p>


