Please, explain how to fix the problem below. Detect long click event for seekbar thumb. Below, you can find more details. <p>I have a seekbar in my android app. I need to detect the long click event for the seekbar in order to perform some action. Suggest me any solution. I have tried out onLongClickListener on the seekbar, but it is not working.</p>
