<p>Also pointing this direction there's this answer in the xamarin forums:</p>

<p><a href="https://forums.xamarin.com/discussion/67698/ios-notifications-while-app-is-closed" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://forums.xamarin.com/discussion/67698/ios-notifications-while-app-is-closed</a></p>

