</blockquote>

<p>My question though is, how can I do that in the Core project shared by the different platforms? I've followed the steps shown at the end of this article in he MvvmCross documentation:</p>

<p><a href="https://www.mvvmcross.com/documentation/advanced/customizing-appstart" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.mvvmcross.com/documentation/advanced/customizing-appstart</a></p>

<p>So my code looks as follows:</p>

<p>App.cs</p>

<pre><code>public class App : MvxApplication&lt;object&gt;
{
    public override void Initialize()
    {
        CreatableTypes().EndingWith("Service").AsInterfaces().RegisterAsLazySingleton();
        Mvx.IoCProvider.LazyConstructAndRegisterSingleton&lt;IAppStartSynchronizer, AppStartSynchronizer&gt;();
        Mvx.IoCProvider.RegisterSingleton(() =&gt; UserDialogs.Instance);

