[SO-15988044] Q: Which Symfony2 version do I use? 2.2 or 2.3?
A: <p>If you need stable <code>right now</code> and the site is mall enough to be fully functional before 2.3 will reach some level of maturity then you should go with 2.2, otherwise 2.3 is the right pick, the fact that is a LTS gives enough support to a long term project.</p>

